    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12364785/comment/12484230",
          "id": "12484230",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dbjohnson.e",
            "name": "dbjohnson.e",
            "key": "dbjohnson.e",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "David Johnson",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "I have upgraded my local version to Lucene 2.1\n\nI needed to change 2 files - the pom.xml of jackrabbit-core and org.apache.jackrabbit.core.query.lucene.PersistentIndex.java\n\nWhile all tests pass, I am not sure if my change to PersistentIndex is right - specifically I commented out the code pertaining to COMMIT_LOCK as this seems to have been removed or moved to another class in Lucene 2.1\n\nIs this worth a patch?  As Marcel stated, this appears to be a good upgrade, so I would like to get this in sooner rather than later.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dbjohnson.e",
            "name": "dbjohnson.e",
            "key": "dbjohnson.e",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "David Johnson",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2007-03-26T21:07:24.850+0000",
          "updated": "2007-03-26T21:07:24.850+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12364785/comment/12484243",
          "id": "12484243",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Please do share a patch with your changes. It's always easier to judge a change if the actual code is available. BTW, would the modified class still work with Lucene 2.0? I also assume that Lucene 2.1 is compatible with indexes created with 2.0.\n\nI agree that we should try to keep up with Lucene upgrades, but on the other hand I would not want to force too frequent dependency changes on users. If the change works with Lucene 2.0, then existing users wouldn't need to upgrade their dependencies. If not, then the upgrade procedure needs to be documented in the release notes.\n\nIf there is no immediate demand for the upgrade, I would rather wait until Jackrabbit 1.3 is branched before doing this.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2007-03-26T21:59:40.684+0000",
          "updated": "2007-03-26T21:59:40.684+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12364785/comment/12484250",
          "id": "12484250",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dbjohnson.e",
            "name": "dbjohnson.e",
            "key": "dbjohnson.e",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "David Johnson",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Patch file for upgrade to Lucene 2.1.0",
